# {{APP_NAME}} (iOS)

Generated by AppStudio. Build & deploy to an iPhone WITHOUT a Mac using xtool:

    cd {{PKG_DIR}}
    xtool dev        # build + run on a connected device (developer mode)
    xtool install    # install the built .ipa

Requires: xtool installed + Apple ID auth (`xtool auth`) + device in Developer Mode.
Assets are served via `WKURLSchemeHandler` at `appstudio://app/index.html` from `Sources/{{SWIFT_NAME}}/Resources/app/` so `fetch('spid3r.wasm')`, `fetch('app.matrix')`, and `localStorage` work reliably without `file://` restrictions.
